Important note about the admin panel
The included admin panel saves changes in the browser using localStorage. It is useful for prototyping, but it is not a secure production dashboard.

For a real production admin system, use:

Frontend: Next.js or React
Backend: Node.js/Express
Database: PostgreSQL or MongoDB
File uploads: Cloudinary, S3, or Supabase Storage
Admin authentication: Clerk, Auth.js, or Firebase Authentication



